          objective: 'First team to 20,000. Need one of each: natural(7 same rank, no wild), mixed(â‰¤3 wild), wild(7 wilds), sevens(7 sevens). Complete a canasta to pick up foot.',
          gameplay: '1. Draw 2 or take discard pile. 2. Meld. 3. Discard. 4. Natural=500, mixed=300, wild=1000, sevens=1500. 5. Sevens cannot discard until both teams have sevens canasta. 6. Red threes: place, draw replacement; 100 each (or -100). 7. Go out: all four canasta types; meld all (or all but one); discard not a seven.',
